WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.241 --> 00:00:03.915
- When Mark bought Instagram
for a billion dollars

00:00:03.915 --> 00:00:06.288
a couple months earlier 
I did some Fox program

00:00:06.288 --> 00:00:08.607
and I said that, it was 
December and they're like,

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:10.953
"Hey, make some 
predictions for 2013."

00:00:10.953 --> 00:00:15.022
This one, I am predicting that 
Facebook acquires Instagram.

00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:18.916
15 million users for Instagram,
probably gonna push 30 next year

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:20.952
and I just have this funny 
feeling that Zucks is gonna

00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:22.616
look at that talent,
look at that app,

00:00:22.616 --> 00:00:24.041
bring it in-house.

00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:27.099
I was like Facebook's 
gonna buy Instagram. Right?

00:00:27.099 --> 00:00:29.306
Cool, whatever.

00:00:29.306 --> 00:00:31.623
Four months later, it happens.

00:00:31.623 --> 00:00:34.191
And CNN asks me to 
come on because the video

00:00:34.191 --> 00:00:36.002
went a little viral in 
the tech community.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:39.429
So I was on Piers Morgan,
on Piers Morgan's show

00:00:39.429 --> 00:00:40.973
his opening line is,

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.222
"This company is 550 days old,

00:00:43.222 --> 00:00:45.372
"how the hell is it 
worth a billion dollars?"

00:00:45.372 --> 00:00:46.503
- And my opening line is

00:00:46.503 --> 00:00:47.925
they stole it.

00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:49.282
I get out of the studio,

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.106
I'm hardcore Twitter 
so I go on it

00:00:51.106 --> 00:00:53.503
and literally there 
are thousands of tweets

00:00:53.503 --> 00:00:56.056
of people calling 
me a fucking idiot.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.978
So literally that night from 
10 o'clock at night to

00:00:58.978 --> 00:01:03.389
4 in the morning I favorited 
every one of those tweets.

00:01:03.389 --> 00:01:05.089
By hand, all of them.

00:01:05.089 --> 00:01:07.471
(audience laughter)

00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:08.396
I think this is a good story

00:01:08.396 --> 00:01:10.332
'cause this is what an 
entrepreneur I think does.

00:01:10.332 --> 00:01:13.797
Favorited them all and then 
I guess last year this time,

00:01:13.797 --> 00:01:17.679
right, Facebook bought 
WhatsApp for $18 billion

00:01:17.679 --> 00:01:20.188
and every article the next 
day after the news came out

00:01:20.188 --> 00:01:23.563
is like oh wait a minute they 
fucking stole Instagram.

00:01:23.563 --> 00:01:27.340
And no joke, for a week, my wife
and I went to Turks and Caicos

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:30.482
for a weekend, Luckily she likes
just to read and I can't bother

00:01:30.482 --> 00:01:33.609
her and I laid on beach 
for 19 hours a day,

00:01:33.609 --> 00:01:36.513
two days in a row and replied 
to every single person

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:37.802
that called me an idiot

00:01:37.802 --> 00:01:39.524
and said, "What now, bitch?"

00:01:39.524 --> 00:01:40.861
(audience laughter)

00:01:40.861 --> 00:01:42.804
(light music)

